 "title": "60 V, 1 A low forward voltage planar Schottky rectifier in SOD123F and SOD323F",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev. 02, 27 March 2007",
  "pages": 10
 },
 "summary": "A single planar Schottky barrier rectifier with a built-in guard ring, rated 60 V reverse and 1 A forward, in two flat-lead surface-mount packages: PMEG6010CEH in SOD123F and PMEG6010CEJ in SOD323F (SC-90). Forward drop is 570 mV typical and 660 mV maximum at 1 A. Intended uses are low-voltage rectification, efficient DC-to-DC converters, switch-mode supplies, reverse-polarity protection and low-power circuits.",
